@host = http://localhost:5100
@conta = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1) Token (Keycloak) — copie o access_token para a variavel abaixo
POST http://localhost:8081/realms/Verx/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=verx-api&grant_type=password&username=cliente.a&password=dev-only-a

### 2) Registrar credito
@token = <cole o access_token>
POST {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "Credito", "valor": 1250.50 }

### 3) Estornar (substitua o id)
POST {{host}}/api/contas/{{conta}}/lancamentos/<id-do-lancamento>/estornos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-estorno-0001
